<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <!--
    Helper 进程(Renderer / GPU / Network / Plugin / utility)的 entitlements。

    **不能跟 main app 共用 entitlements.mac.plist** — main app 的 entitlements
    含 keychain-access-groups,需要 provisioning profile 授权,而 provisioning
    profile 只放在 main app Contents/embedded.provisionprofile,helper.app 没
    有 profile。helper 进程启动时 macOS 会校验 entitlement vs profile,不匹
    配 → SIGKILL(exit_code=9)→ GPU/Network 重启 5 次失败 → main FATAL abort。

    这就是 v0.2.70 (3e1c657 钥匙串迁移) 启动崩溃的根因(2026-05-20 事故)。
    详见 docs/claude-guides/release-checklist.md §helper-entitlements-trap。

    Helper 进程**只保留** Hardened Runtime 必需 + 子进程通信需要的能力,**剥离**
    所有只有 main app 用的 capability:
      ✗ keychain-access-groups        (只有 main 跑 secure-store)
      ✗ automation.apple-events        (只有 main 调 osascript Apple Notes)
      ✗ files.user-selected.*          (只有 main 弹 file dialog)
    保留的:
      ✓ allow-jit                     V8 JIT(Renderer 必需)
      ✓ allow-unsigned-executable-memory   V8 codegen
      ✓ disable-library-validation     dlopen 第三方 dylib(better-sqlite3 等)
      ✓ allow-dyld-environment-variables   Electron 子进程 fork-exec 继承
      ✓ network.client / network.server   Renderer fetch / IPC
  -->
  <key>com.apple.security.cs.allow-jit</key>
  <true/>
  <key>com.apple.security.cs.allow-unsigned-executable-memory</key>
  <true/>
  <key>com.apple.security.cs.disable-library-validation</key>
  <true/>
  <key>com.apple.security.cs.allow-dyld-environment-variables</key>
  <true/>
  <key>com.apple.security.network.client</key>
  <true/>
  <key>com.apple.security.network.server</key>
  <true/>
</dict>
</plist>
